    "detailed_description": "<strong>About Throneforge - The Fortress War:</strong><br>Embark on a strategic journey in Throneforge - The Fortress War, a captivating 2D tower defense game that challenges players to defend their city against relentless waves of enemies. As the guardian of your realm, it is your duty to construct powerful towers, conduct groundbreaking research, and manage a workforce to fortify your defenses and secure the survival of your kingdom.<br><br><strong>Tower Construction and Variety:</strong><br>Build an arsenal of diverse towers, each with unique abilities and strengths.<br>Strategically place towers along the enemy's path to maximize their impact and create impenetrable defense lines.<br><br><strong>Upgrades:</strong><br>Upgrade your towers to unleash devastating attacks, increase range, and unlock special abilities to fend off increasingly formidable foes.<br><br><strong>Endless Mode and Challenges:</strong><br>Test your strategic prowess in an endless mode, facing increasingly difficult waves of enemies to see how long you can survive.<br>Take on special challenges that push your tactical skills to the limit, earning valuable rewards for your accomplishments.",
